    "name": "eBay Account Advertising_eligibility User API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The <b>Account API</b> gives sellers the ability to configure their eBay seller accounts, including the seller's policies (eBay business policies and seller-defined custom policies), opt in and out of eBay seller programs, configure sales tax tables, and get account information.  <br><br>For details on the availability of the methods in this API, see <a href=\"/api-docs/sell/account/overview.html#requirements\">Account API requirements and restrictions</a>.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: eBay Inc,",
